The networks and stations come from the CityBikes project (https://citybik.es),
a free API powered by PyBikes (https://github.com/eskerda/pybikes), which
gathers the data published by the bike sharing operators. Its terms ask every
project using the API to say so and link to it: the widgets show
"Data: CityBikes (citybik.es)", and the documentation and the README credit it.
The files under test/fixtures are reduced answers of this API, kept for the
tests only.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
the CityBikes project or by any bike sharing operator.
